<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-F002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-F002" ;
  triage:title "Mechanical acceptance gate loop count not input diversity" ;
  triage:description "The mechanical acceptance gate for atm-template-checked-emission (minimum_invocations >= 100) is satisfied purely by loop count, not input diversity. All four AN.15 probe tests implement their '100 cases' as `for case_index in 0..100 { ... }` where case_index is only interpolated into an otherwise fixed template/value/path string. This satisfies the sprint's '>= 100 seeded cases' gate without actual structural/class diversity across the 100 iterations. The gate cannot currently distinguish a genuinely varied 100-case corpus from a single case looped 100 times with a counter suffix." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-an" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-quality" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-08-14T19:50:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AN.15 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-08-14T19:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:resolutionNotes "Update 2026-08-15 by quality-mgr, AN15FUZZV2-QA1FIX1-VERIFY: arch-ctm's fix at integrate/phase-an @ 565620a32e6aeb3480f7de4da0b26fb8ac1d1769 independently verified via ruthless-boundary-qa. `.just/run_fuzz.py:116-117` defines a diversity gate (MINIMUM_DISTINCT_CASE_SHAPES=4) enforced by `_require_diverse_case_shapes` (lines 640-666): fails closed unless exactly one shape marker is retained per seeded case, at least 4 distinct shapes are present, and no shape exceeds half the corpus. Called unconditionally from `_checked_emission_worker` (line 693) before a worker result validates. All five original occurrences (.just/run_fuzz.py:302; template.rs:246-254; render.rs:211-219; lib.rs:646-654; lib.rs:1301-1315) now emit five genuine structurally-distinct input families (plain/unicode/whitespace/quoted/multiline, or 5 distinct path-escape shapes for the boundary-probe), each occurring 20/100 times. A real, non-mocked unit test at .just/tests/test_run_fuzz.py:243-256 (test_checked_emission_executor_rejects_a_counter_only_corpus) proves a degenerate distinct_shapes=1 corpus is rejected with FuzzInputError; a companion positive test (lines 223-241) proves a genuine 4-shape corpus passes. Sealed-adapter boundary reconfirmed intact; no ATM-to-sc-compose shell-out introduced. Closing." ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/RBQA-F002/rbqa-f002-1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/RBQA-F002/rbqa-f002-2> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/RBQA-F002/rbqa-f002-3> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/RBQA-F002/rbqa-f002-4> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/RBQA-F002/rbqa-f002-5> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" .

